    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "## When to use\nUse when creating a Powerhouse Fusion project, deciding or verifying which Switchboard instance it should use as its backend, or starting and stopping its development server.\n\n## What it covers\n- Quick reference\n- References\n- Common mistakes\n- Reporting\n- FPM.00.1 Inspect existing projects\n- FPM.00.2 Generate unique project name\n- FPM.00.3 Initialize the project\n- FPM.01.1 Consider which backend should be used\n- FPM.01.2 Start a Reactor Package project if needed\n- FPM.01.3 Identify and verify the Switchboard URL\n- FPM.02.1 Start the project and wait until it's ready\n- FPM.02.2 Parse and verify the Fusion endpoint\n- FPM.03.1 Verify project is running\n- FPM.03.2 Shutdown the project\n\n## Where the full skill lives\n- Vault source: **Agent skill: fusion-project** (full text, DERIVED_FROM below) \u2014 the vault is this skill's home.\n- Upstream origin: https://github.com/powerhouse-inc/powerhouse-dev-skills/tree/main/skills/fusion-project\n\n## Invocation\nRead the vault source content and follow it. Not a plugin command.\n\n_Added via add-skill; content hash sha256:c738efd38d51\u2026_",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-17T12:12:45.276Z"
